name    vi
prog    vi /dd/DOC/README-CIO
# THE REAL vi/ex -- its source in SRC/effo_vi is the Berkeley ex source.
# Opened on a file, moved through, and left with :q! so nothing is written.
rate    0.5
wait    8
snap    opened
keys    jjjj
wait    2
keys    G
wait    3
snap    bottom
key     \033
keys    :q!
key     \r
wait    3
expect  README-CIO
absent  Can't install trap handler
